# What is NOT part of the pack.
#
# Distribution Spec §4 defines the pack as config/, defaultconfigs/, kubejs/,
# resourcepacks/, datapacks/, ftbquests/ and the manifest — the files that carry
# gameplay. Everything else in this repository is the operating layer: how we
# build the pack, not the pack itself.
#
# Without this file `packwiz refresh` indexes the whole repo, and a friend
# installing the pack downloads CLAUDE.md, the ADRs and the git hooks.

# --- the agent operating layer -----------------------------------------------
.claude/
.githooks/
.github/
scripts/
Obsidian-minecraft-100day/

# --- documentation -----------------------------------------------------------
docs/
*.md

# --- repo metadata -----------------------------------------------------------
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.packwizignore

# --- local build / runtime output --------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
run/
instance/
logs/
crash-reports/
saves/
*.mrpack
*.zip
